[00:00.000]
[00:00.193]Say my name when a tree susurrates
{"当树木沙沙作响时 呼唤我的名字"}
[00:11.904]Once and again telling a story lost in time
{"一遍又一遍 讲述着湮没时光的故事"}
[00:17.765]the way it starts and the way it ends
{"故事如何开始 又将如何结束"}
[00:23.865]Never again making up stories in dismay
{"再也不会在绝望中编造故事"}
[00:29.445]With several starts, but just one end
{"虽有万千开端 却只有一个终点"}
[00:35.819]
[00:36.615]Ah, how I long to embrace
{"啊 我多么渴望拥抱"}
[00:47.513]The future breaking out of shades from the past
{"冲破往昔阴霾的未来"}
[00:56.536]Still ablaze
{"依旧炽烈燃烧"}
[01:03.181]
